    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "AIR CALIFORNIA\nFlight Schedule\nEffective January 12, 1971",
      "Now Air California flies\nto San Diego\nAir California makes another\naddition to its ever-growing\nservice area as it inaugurates flights\nbetween San Diego and the\nSan Francisco Bay region's most\nconvenient airports: San Jose and\nOakland.\nThese major California business\nand recreation centers are now\nlinked by six Air California flights\na day each way. Now, there's a new\ndirect way to the water wonderland\nof Mission Bay, to world famous\nSan Diego Zoo, to all the beauty of\nCalifornia's oldest city."
    ],
